nt": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Famous People", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Famous for the Right Reasons", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Personal Qualities", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about someone you admire, you can talk about the qualities in them that you admire.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use adjectives to describe personal qualities. Here is a list of adjectives you can use: ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"creative</br> loud</br> sweet</br> popular</br> fiery</br> charming</br> charismatic</br>  outgoing</br> quiet</br> confident\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"artistic; has original ideas</br> often speaks at full volume</br> ever-tempered; pleasant</br> admired; liked by everyone</br> passionate;quick-tempered</br> pleasing;lovely</br> charming; fascinating</br> friendly; easy-going</br> silent; still</br> positive; self assured\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "She was very popular with the citizens.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The woman was fiery yet confident.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Adverbs of manner tell us how something happens. They are usually placed either after the main verb or after the object.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Example:<br />  <span class=\"italic\">She was immensely popular with the poor.<br />  How popular was she? Immensely.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br />Sometimes an adverb of manner is placed before a verb + object to add emphasis. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br /><span class=\"italic\"> She boldly left her home to study .</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br />Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"italic\">-ly</span> to an adjective.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br /><span class=\"italic\"> bold \u2192 boldly     &nbsp; &nbsp;                  happy \u2192 happily</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <br />Some adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"italic\">-ally</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">general \u2192 generally       &nbsp; &nbsp;      beautiful \u2192 beautifully</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br />  <span class=\"italic\">She was famously referred to as \u201cLittle Eva.\u201d<br /> She spoke quickly.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Eva Peron, famously called Evita, served as Argentina's First Lady.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She boldly left her home to study, and hopefully become a famous actress.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to serve", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to spend a period of time doing work for a country", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She spent her time serving the citizens of Argentina.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about personal qualities.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "First Lady", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the wife of the leader of a country", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She became Argentina's First Lady in 1946.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bold", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not afraid of taking risks and making difficult decisions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peron was a bold woman. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bright lights", "type": "name"}, {"content": "places of entertainment ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In search of the bright lights, Eva moved to the big city at 15.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "debut ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the first public appearance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her acting debut was in 1935 when she naturally joined a theatre company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "breakthrough", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a chance you get after trying for a long time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her real breakthrough came when she became a high-paid radio actress with Radio Belgrano.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fiery", "type": "name"}, {"content": "becoming excited very quickly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was quite fiery when speaking.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "charismatic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "possessing the natural quality of attraction and charm ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Eva Peron was very charismatic. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rags-to-riches", "type": "name"}, {"content": "becoming very rich after starting life very poor", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her rags-to-riches story went on to become the subject of movies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Imagine you must write a letter to Eva Peron.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask her five questions about her life. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How do you think she helped the world? Tell her how important she is in today's world.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your letter aloud to your partner. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a letter to Eva Peron.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the Simple Past tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about how something happened. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my letter aloud. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}